    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Lancet-2, I have a serious question.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Go ahead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lancet-2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Isn't your battery running low?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, don't worry about that. Before we left, the lovely Ms. Closure fitted me with a brand new, extra long-lasting battery.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lancet-2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Theoretically, I could function for a week without needing a charge.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lancet-2"
    },
    {
        "text": "The aircraft is also carrying spare batteries, so you don't have to worry about me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lancet-2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now where did Kay run off to? On our way back, the kiddo suddenly hopped to her feet and jetted away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's true, we should be concerned about Ceobe's condition, but considering her strength and constitution, we don't need to be too concerned.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lancet-2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's true.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah, I'm bored.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "text": "We fixed up the aircraft, patched up the wounded Gavial sent over, and now we've got nothing to do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "text": "That we can't speak the local language is just a cherry on top. I should've gone to that ceremony with the Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The aircraft is an important Rhodes Island asset, it's our responsibility to guard it well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lancet-2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm just saying. I mean, I'm a pilot, I know the deal with the aircraft.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're lucky, Lancet-2, you can just switch into sleep mode when you're bored. I was out for twelve hours yesterday, so I'm wide awake.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, actually, I have no ability to feel 'boredom'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lancet-2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Although I do understand what this feeling is, Mr. Dylan. The lovely Ms. Closure complains about these things a lot. And it causes her to behave in strange ways.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lancet-2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...I think about this sometimes, Lancet-2, are we totally sure you and the other bots don't have a human crammed up in there anywhere?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We don't. My interior is a precisely-designed circuitry construct. Do you want to see?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lancet-2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Although, since I have been programmed with a female personality, I may act out in unexpected ways when presenting my body to the opposite sex.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lancet-2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Err, I'll pass.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "text": "If was going to see anything, I'd definitely prefer a swimsuit at a time like this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "A swimsuit?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lancet-2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, it's summertime. That's when you put on a swimsuit and go play in the water.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "In that case, I'll play an audio recording of various sea sounds for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lancet-2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No thanks, it'd only make me feel worse.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Then maybe... Mr. Dylan would like to see me in a swimsuit?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lancet-2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Definitely not!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, sorry. I am only a robot, after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lancet-2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Err, I'm the one who's sorry. I didn't mean it like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry about it. By the way, have you seen the sea, Mr. Dylan?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lancet-2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Um, I have. I'm thinking it was that time we loaned Master SilverAsh an aircraft last summer after a schedule change mixed things up. I flew him there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "text": "It turns out, the place was a major vacation spot. Master SilverAsh made me a VIP guest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Man, that's when I realized how us poor folks could scarcely imagine what the rich live like.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here, I've got the pictures with me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You long for this kind of life, Mr. Dylan?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lancet-2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm? I mean... that was a really great couple of days, but if my whole life was like that, I don't think I'd ever get used to it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm more of an instant-noodles-in-the-cockpit kind of guy. With an inverted sleep schedule to boot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh you can't do that. Let me formulate a healthy lifestyle plan for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lancet-2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No thanks, I'm good!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Too bad. The lovely Ms. Closure created this feature for me, but no one uses it. Not her, not the Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lancet-2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha, sounds about right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, but that reminds me, the tribes here live so much better than I thought. They really want for nothing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, life here is less convenient and comfortable than the world we know, but not to any significant degree.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lancet-2"
    },
    {
        "text": "According to my records, your health has improved in the past two days.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lancet-2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Really?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Really.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lancet-2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Turns out returning to nature will do that for you. Heh. I guess this is the life that everyone came from.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh yeah, I just remembered, Gavial said something about a gigantic waterfall in the rainforest that way. I'd love to go there when the Doctor gets back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "They may have already gone that way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lancet-2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The Doctor is a good boss. And I know our friends wouldn't abandon us to go play under the waterfall!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "True. Then let's wait patiently.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lancet-2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Is there a 'Dylan' here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? You speak Sargonian?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. And you're here with the machine. Right, it must be you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "text": "The one called 'Doctor' asked me to give you this note.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inam"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_075",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm? Let's see here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Lancet-2, looks like we've got work to do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dylan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
