    },
    {
        "text": "You got a lotta fight in you, squirt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_415_flint_1",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_summer",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Flint"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_415_flint_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kemar, well aware of the language barrier, communicates with her stance, rather than words."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_415_flint_1",
        "name2": "char_017_homura_summer",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh. Seeing as I've got nothing else to do, we might as well go a few rounds.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "largebg",
        "imagegroup": "bg_falls_1/bg_falls_2",
        "solidwidth": "920/920",
        "solidheight": 720,
        "x": -180
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
