        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Blaze is really going at it hard with that girl over there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd_summer",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1#3",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd_summer",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't see what's so fun about fighting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1#3",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd_summer",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...I heard you singin' a whole 'nother tune last time you was fightin', Utage.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd_summer",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahahaha. I guess you're right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, Croissant, that isn't a swimsuit, is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd_summer",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahahaha, ya got me. It's just some outdoorsy getup I snagged. Plenty waterproof, so we'n pretend it's a swimsuit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1#2",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd_summer",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're a real function over form kinda girl, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "text": "But hey, it may not be a beach, but playing around a waterfall is pretty great too! It's got that real 'back to nature' vibe. Too bad I didn't bring my camera.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1#2",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd_summer",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ya got that right. I ain't never been out in the wilds like this before. I'm havin' a ball!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1#4",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd_summer",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1#4",
        "name2": "char_201_moeshd_summer",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Whassat?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Am I seeing things?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd_summer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Isn't that Kay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
