        "duration": 30,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_summer_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How do you like the waterfall, Doctor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "It's nice.;......;Meh.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_summer_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah, I used to love coming here to bathe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_summer_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like you've got a lot on your mind, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_summer_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're cruisin' for a bruisin', Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_summer_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "From here it's just a short walk to Zumama's tribe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "When I got that letter from Tomimi, I never thought things would turn out like this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Oh, Doctor, there's one thing that's been really gnawing at my brain these past few days. We're friends, right? I wanna ask you about it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_summer_1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you think...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doooctooor!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's happening? I'm trying to talk to the Doctor here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look over there!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that... Kay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "I found it! The Mushroom Sea!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bath time!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like she's still off in la la land.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "But she's just so cute rolling around in the water like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gah, stupid kid.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "How about we just let her play for a while...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyway, Doctor, what I wanted to ask was\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you think my tail's gotten fatter?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Yes.;......;I didn't notice.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_summer_1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.6,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "What? Really? I guess I'm going on a diet when we get back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_summer_1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Come on, Doctor, don't look at me like that. An Archosauria's tail is her most prized asset! This is my life!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_summer_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pfft, I knew I shouldn't have asked you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_summer_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't know, Tomimi's tail wasn't always that fat. And I don't want mine to end up like hers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "What do you think about Zumama?;......;Let's talk about tails more.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_summer_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? What do I think about her?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess I think she's real tough, and she can make a helluva machine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_summer_1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_summer_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I had a feeling you'd be down with tails!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "Gavial!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_summer_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "There's Tomimi. You done with that thing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_summer_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmmmmm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh-What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're a cutie! Gavial, I never knew you had a friend like this. I thought you just hung around with other muscleheaded lunks like you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1#2",
        "name2": "char_187_ccheal_summer_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That was uncalled for!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's got perfect skin, refined features, and a gothy outfit that really goes with her complexion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1",
        "name2": "char_187_ccheal_summer_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Gothy? Is that in?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1",
        "name2": "char_187_ccheal_summer_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, no. But it's popular with a certain crowd.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I-I picked it up from a magazine. They said it's how they dress in the outside world.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, no, girl, honey. You've got a critically flawed understanding of fashion here. But that's okay. I mean, look at this place. I totally get why you'd come up with something like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "text": "But don't worry, you just let Big Sister Utage fill you with her bottomless, extra-thick fashion wisdom!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gavial, I'm borrowing her!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wha? Whaaaaaaa?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_summer_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure, knock yourself out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyway, we're all here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll see if I can get Kay to sober up...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Break time's over! Kay is back in the fight!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd_summer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gavial, she's makin' a break for it again!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_summer_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Grr, everybody, get your clothes on! We're going after her!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "That direction... it's the way to Zumama's tribe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold on! Did you really change that fast?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait up!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_summer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why bother changing? Just go!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
